  "description": "Su-Jong, struggling to raise his daughter alone while facing financial hardship, is offered a part-time job as a test subject for research conducted by his university junior, Woo-Min. Lured by the high compensation, Su-Jong signs the contract without fully understanding the nature of the research. Only later does he realize his body has been completely altered...\n\n *“You look better on the receiving end, senior.”*\n\nShame and pleasure. Where can one escape from the end of this inescapable contract...?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
